{
  "id": "the-simpsons---4x17---last-exit-to-springfielden",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 4x17 - Last Exit to Springfield.en",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 4x17 - Last Exit to Springfield.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-08-31T04:14:29.513Z",
  "lineCount": 285,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "[Chorus] ## The Simpsons ##",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 3095,
      "endMs": 6394
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "[Bell Ringing]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 9101,
      "endMs": 11365
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "[Whistle Blowing]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 12905,
      "endMs": 16102
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "[ Beeping ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 19545,
      "endMs": 21445
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "## [Jazzy Solo ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 27052,
      "endMs": 30954
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "[ Tires Screeching ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 32758,
      "endMs": 34658
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "D'oh! [ Screams ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 36028,
      "endMs": 37996
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "[ Gulping ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 41834,
      "endMs": 43734
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "## [ Classical ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 57650,
      "endMs": 60210
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "[ Clinking Glass ] My friends!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 62922,
      "endMs": 65117
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Tonight we unveil my most diabolical creation.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 65224,
      "endMs": 68785
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Swank. Ten times more addictive than marijuana.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 71664,
      "endMs": 75964
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Ooh! To human misery!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 76068,
      "endMs": 80300
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "[ Rattling ] [ All Gasping ] Uh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 80406,
      "endMs": 85342
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Nice to see you. McBain!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 87146,
      "endMs": 91378
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "[ All Grunting ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 93485,
      "endMs": 95453
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "[ Gasps ] Yes. [ Grunts ] Ah, McBain, so glad you could make it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 104196,
      "endMs": 112334
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Have a salmon puff. All right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 112438,
      "endMs": 115635
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "[ Gags, Screams ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 116909,
      "endMs": 118809
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "[ Sinister Laughing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 118911,
      "endMs": 122347
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "That is one evil dude.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 126418,
      "endMs": 128318
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "It's just a movie, son. There's nobody that evil in real life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 128420,
      "endMs": 132652
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "[ Sinister Laughing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 132758,
      "endMs": 134385
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "[ Gasping ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 134493,
      "endMs": 139294
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "[Screaming] Smithers, where's that union representative?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 139398,
      "endMs": 141798
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "He's 20 minutes late.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 141900,
      "endMs": 143800
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "Uh, I don't know, sir. He hasn't been seen since he promised to clean up the union.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 143902,
      "endMs": 147929
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Whoa! What the hell?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 149174,
      "endMs": 152143
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "Well, let's look at the contract ourselves, eh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 152244,
      "endMs": 155236
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Benefits, perks, a green cookie on St. Patrick's Day?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 155347,
      "endMs": 159784
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Oh-ho, it didn't use to be this way, Smithers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 159885,
      "endMs": 162353
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "No, it didn't use to be this way at all.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 162454,
      "endMs": 165651
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Come on, come on! Crack those atoms!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 174533,
      "endMs": 177001
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "You, turn out those pockets!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 177102,
      "endMs": 179935
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Atoms.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 180039,
      "endMs": 182166
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "One, two, three, four-- Six of them!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 182274,
      "endMs": 184799
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "Take him away!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 184910,
      "endMs": 187105
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "You can't treat the workingman this way!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 187212,
      "endMs": 189510
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "One day, we'll form a union and get the fair and equitable treatment we deserve.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 189615,
      "endMs": 193984
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "Then we'll go too far and get corrupt and shiftless... and the Japanese will eat us alive!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 194086,
      "endMs": 199552
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "The Japanese? Those sandal-wearing goldfish tenders?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 199658,
      "endMs": 203458
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "[ Laughs ] Bosh! Flimshaw!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 203562,
      "endMs": 205894
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "If only we had listened to that boy... instead of walling him up in the abandoned coke oven.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 208000,
      "endMs": 213663
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Well, I am going to avenge my grandfather.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 213772,
      "endMs": 217230
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "We'll take on that greedy union... and we'll get back our... dental plan.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 217342,
      "endMs": 225775
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "How often do you brush, Ralph? Three times a day, sir.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 231256,
      "endMs": 234316
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Why must you turn my office into a house of lies?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 234426,
      "endMs": 238328
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "You're right! I don't brush! [ Crying ] I don't brush.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 238430,
      "endMs": 242161
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Let's look at a picture book...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 242267,
      "endMs": 244394
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "The Big Book of British Smiles.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 244503,
      "endMs": 248303
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "[ Sobbing ] That's enough! That's enough!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 255647,
      "endMs": 259947
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Dr. Wolfe likes to pull kids' teeth, so he can sell 'em.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 260052,
      "endMs": 263283
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "To who?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 263388,
      "endMs": 264616
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "You know that rattle when you shake up spray paint?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 264723,
      "endMs": 267021
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "That's a kid's tooth. [ Shuddering ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 267126,
      "endMs": 270755
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "Maggie's teeth are coming in crooked.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 273866,
      "endMs": 276334
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Has she been sucking on a pacifier?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 276435,
      "endMs": 278903
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Uh... not to my knowledge. Liar!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 279004,
      "endMs": 281768
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "I'm also afraid little Lisa is going to need braces.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 283709,
      "endMs": 287440
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "Oh, no! I'll be socially unpopular.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 287546,
      "endMs": 291107
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "More so. Are you sure, Doctor?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 291216,
      "endMs": 293616
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Well, judge for yourself.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 293719,
      "endMs": 296210
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "Here's Lisa today.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 296321,
      "endMs": 298221
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "Without treatment, here's what she'll look like at age 11... age 14, age 17... and, finally, age 18.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 298323,
      "endMs": 308760
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "[ Gasps ] Cool! She'll be a freak.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 308867,
      "endMs": 311734
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Bart!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 311837,
      "endMs": 313737
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "We can stick her in a trailer, drive her around the South and charge two bits a gander.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 313839,
      "endMs": 317366
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "[ TV: Man ] Now stay tuned for professional wrestling live... from the Springfield Grapplarium.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 317476,
      "endMs": 321945
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Tonight, a Texas death match-- Dr. Hillbilly versus The Iron Yuppie!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 322047,
      "endMs": 326279
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "One man will actually be unmasked and killed in the ring!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 326385,
      "endMs": 330116
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "I hope they kill that Iron Yuppie. Thinks he's so big.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 330222,
      "endMs": 333589
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "Homer, Lisa needs braces.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 333692,
      "endMs": 336388
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "Don't worry. We won a dental plan in the strike of'88.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 336495,
      "endMs": 340022
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "That's where I got this scar.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 340132,
      "endMs": 342566
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "What do we want?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 342668,
      "endMs": 344295
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "More equitable treatment in the hands of management!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 344403,
      "endMs": 346837
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "[Carl] When do we want it? [All]Soon!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 346939,
      "endMs": 348839
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "Where's my burrito? Where's my burrito?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 348941,
      "endMs": 352570
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Where's my burrito? Ow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 352678,
      "endMs": 355272
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Then I got this scar sneaking under the door of a pay toilet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 355380,
      "endMs": 359476
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "[People Chattering] [Electrical Feedback] Welcome, brothers ofLocal643.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 359585,
      "endMs": 364981
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "As you know, our president, Chucky Fitzhugh, ain't been seen lately.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 365090,
      "endMs": 368526
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "We're all praying he'll turn up soon, alive and well.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 368627,
      "endMs": 371187
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Oh, all right, all right. But seriously, we have to vote on Burns's new contract.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 373899,
      "endMs": 377357
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "It's basically the same deal, except we get a free keg of beer for our meetin'.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 377469,
      "endMs": 381235
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "[ All ] Yea!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 381340,
      "endMs": 383240
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "In exchange for that, we have to give up our dental plan.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 383342,
      "endMs": 386209
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "So long, dental plan!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 387746,
      "endMs": 389941
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "[Lenny's Voice] Dental plan! [Marge's Voice] Lisa needs braces.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 390048,
      "endMs": 393540
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "Dental plan! Lisa needs braces.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 393652,
      "endMs": 396246
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "Dental plan! Lisa needs braces.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 396355,
      "endMs": 398789
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Dental plan! Lisa needs braces.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 398890,
      "endMs": 401518
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Dental plan! Lisa needs braces.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 401627,
      "endMs": 404391
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "Dental plan! Lisa needs braces.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 404496,
      "endMs": 407727
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "Bull's-eye! [ Chortles ] Thanks a lot, Carl. Now I've lost my train of thought.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 407833,
      "endMs": 412668
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "Dental plan! Lisa needs braces.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 412771,
      "endMs": 415740
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Dental plan! Lisa needs braces.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 415841,
      "endMs": 418935
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "If we give up our dental plan...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 419044,
      "endMs": 422343
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "I'll have to pay for Lisa's braces!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 422447,
      "endMs": 424779
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "People, stop! We can't give up our dental plan!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 424883,
      "endMs": 428216
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "Lenny, without that dental plan, you wouldn't have that diamond in your tooth.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 428320,
      "endMs": 432381
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "Yoink! Hey!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 432491,
      "endMs": 435551
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "And, Gummy Joe, where would you be without that dental plan?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 435661,
      "endMs": 439791
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "Well, I wouldn't have old chomper here, that's for sure.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 439898,
      "endMs": 443356
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "You know what I think of this contract?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 445904,
      "endMs": 448464
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "This! [ Angry Grunting ] [ Cheering ] Yeah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 448573,
      "endMs": 456478
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "Who is that firebrand, Smithers? That's Homer Simpson, sir.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 458016,
      "endMs": 461611
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Simpson, eh? New man?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 461720,
      "endMs": 463517
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Actually, sir, he thwarted your campaign for governor... you ran over his son, he saved the plant from meltdown... and his wife painted you in the nude-- Eh, doesn't ring a bell.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 463622,
      "endMs": 474591
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "[ Chanting ] Homer! Homer! Homer!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 474700,
      "endMs": 477601
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "I move that Homer Simpson be our new union president.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 477703,
      "endMs": 480934
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "All in favor? Aye!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 481039,
      "endMs": 483166
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "All opposed? -[Man]Nay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 483275,
      "endMs": 485641
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Congratulations, Homer. [ Cheering ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 485744,
      "endMs": 489202
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "Hey, what does this job pay? Nothin'.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 489314,
      "endMs": 491646
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "D'oh! Unless you're crooked.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 491750,
      "endMs": 493479
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "Whoo-hoo!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 493585,
      "endMs": 495553
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "President of the union? I'm so proud of you, Homie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 497923,
      "endMs": 502383
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "This is your chance to get a fair shake for the workingman.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 502494,
      "endMs": 505725
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "And make lifelong connections to the world of organized crime.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 505831,
      "endMs": 509858
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "Hmm. Organized crime.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 509968,
      "endMs": 513404
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Don Homer, I have baked a special donut just for you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 517943,
      "endMs": 522471
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "Mmm. Grazie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 524683,
      "endMs": 527652
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "Don Homer, my son, he has a-trouble with the-- Eh-eh-eh-eh-eh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 529988,
      "endMs": 535826
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "Moltobene.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 536928,
      "endMs": 539294
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "That's a nice a-donut.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 542134,
      "endMs": 544364
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "Do you think you can get the dental plan back?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 544469,
      "endMs": 546937
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "Well, that depends on who's a better negotiator-- Mr. Burns or me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 547038,
      "endMs": 550997
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "Dad, I'll trade you this delicious doorstop for your crummy old Danish.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 551109,
      "endMs": 555409
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "Done and done! [ Laughing ] D'oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 555514,
      "endMs": 562048
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "Lisa and Marge, these braces are invisible, painless... and periodically release a delightful burst... of Calvin Klein's Obsession for Teeth.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 562154,
      "endMs": 571559
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "[ Sniffing ] Hmm!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 571663,
      "endMs": 573927
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "Doctor, we don't have a dental plan right now... so we'll need something a little more... affordable.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 574032,
      "endMs": 581166
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "These predate stainless steel... so you can't get them wet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 581273,
      "endMs": 586073
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "[ Coughs ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 587412,
      "endMs": 589243
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "Hmm, he's a worthy foe. Look at him, Smithers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 589347,
      "endMs": 592578
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "Exercising away while the others are off at the candy machine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 592684,
      "endMs": 596381
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "[ Grunting ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 596488,
      "endMs": 599048
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "Hey, Lenny, can you get this Sugar Daddy off my back?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 599157,
      "endMs": 602786
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "Okay, but it's the last time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 602894,
      "endMs": 605522
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "Mmm!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 606898,
      "endMs": 608798
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "We don't have to be adversaries, Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 608900,
      "endMs": 611368
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "We both want a fair union contract.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 611470,
      "endMs": 613802
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "[ Thinking ] Why is Mr. Burns being so nice to me?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 613905,
      "endMs": 616396
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "And if you'll scratch my back, I'll scratch yours.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 616508,
      "endMs": 620239
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "Wait a minute. Is he coming on to me?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 620345,
      "endMs": 622973
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "I mean, if I should slip something into your pocket, what's the harm?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 623081,
      "endMs": 627040
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "Oh, my God! He is coming on to me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 627152,
      "endMs": 629620
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "After all, negotiations make strange bedfellows.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 629721,
      "endMs": 633623
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "[ Chortling, Clicks Tongue ] [ Silent Scream ] Sorry, Mr. Burns, but I don't go in for these backdoor shenanigans.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 633725,
      "endMs": 641030
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "Sure, I'm flattered, maybe even a little curious, but the answer is no.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 641132,
      "endMs": 645296
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "[ Sighs ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 645403,
      "endMs": 646961
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "Lisa, so you won't be scared...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 647072,
      "endMs": 648972
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "I'll show you some of the tools I'll be using.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 649074,
      "endMs": 651565
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "This is the scraper, this is the poker... and this happy little fellow is the gouger.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 651676,
      "endMs": 659179
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "[ Loud Whirring ] [ Whimpers ] Now, the first thing I'll be doing... is chiseling some teeth out of your jaw bone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 659284,
      "endMs": 666691
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "Hold still while I gas you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 666791,
      "endMs": 669589
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "[ British Accent ] Look, fellas! It's Lisa in the sky!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 695921,
      "endMs": 698355
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "No diamonds though.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 698456,
      "endMs": 699821
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "Look out for the campy drawing of Queen Victoria!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 699925,
      "endMs": 702792
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "Oh, no!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 702894,
      "endMs": 704794
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "God, help us! Help us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 704896,
      "endMs": 707364
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "The mirror.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 710769,
      "endMs": 713397
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "The mirror!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 713505,
      "endMs": 716565
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "[ Maniacal Laughing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 716675,
      "endMs": 720133
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "Honey, you look fine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 725917,
      "endMs": 728750
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "[ Barking ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 728853,
      "endMs": 730821
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "[ Whimpering ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 730922,
      "endMs": 733948
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "-[Door Bell Rings] Who is it?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 736227,
      "endMs": 738559
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "[Man]Goons. Who?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 738663,
      "endMs": 740563
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "Hired goons. Hired goons?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 740665,
      "endMs": 744192
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "[ Grunts ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 744302,
      "endMs": 746930
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "[ Sinister Chortling ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 748340,
      "endMs": 751798
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "Ah, Homer, I hope Crusher and Low Blow didn't hurt you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 755280,
      "endMs": 759444
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "You know, you could have just called me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 759551,
      "endMs": 761781
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "Oh, yes, but the telephone is so impersonal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 761886,
      "endMs": 764411
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "I prefer the hands-on touch you only get with hired goons.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 764522,
      "endMs": 768083
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "Hired goons?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 768193,
      "endMs": 770093
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "This is the largest TV in the free world.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 770195,
      "endMs": 773323
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "�Ay, un gatomalodoro!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 777235,
      "endMs": 779965
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "[ Disgusted Shudder]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 780071,
      "endMs": 782631
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "This is a thousand monkeys working at a thousand typewriters.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 784409,
      "endMs": 787640
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "Soon, they'll have written the greatest novel known to man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 787746,
      "endMs": 791238
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "Let's see.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 791349,
      "endMs": 793249
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "\"It was the best of times, it was the \"blurst' of times\"?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 793351,
      "endMs": 796912
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "You stupid monkey! [ Hooting ] Oh, shut up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 797022,
      "endMs": 801885
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "[Water Dripping]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 801993,
      "endMs": 804154
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "And this is my basement. Gee, it's not as nice as the other rooms.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 804262,
      "endMs": 808756
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "Yes, I really should stop ending the tour with it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 808867,
      "endMs": 812928
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "Now, let's get down to business. [ Thinking ] Oh, man!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 813038,
      "endMs": 816007
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "I have to go to the bathroom.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 816107,
      "endMs": 818007
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "Why did I have all that beer and coffee and watermelon?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 818109,
      "endMs": 820600
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "Now, Homer, I know what you're thinking, and I want to take the pressure off.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 820712,
      "endMs": 824512
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "It doesn't take a whiz to see that you're looking out for number one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 824616,
      "endMs": 828074
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "Well, listen tome, and you'll make a big splash very soon.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 828186,
      "endMs": 831986
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "Oh! Which way to the bathroom? Oh, it's the 23rd door on the left.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 832090,
      "endMs": 835924
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "Nope. Nope. Nope.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 836027,
      "endMs": 839656
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "[ Sighs ] He wouldn't even hear me out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 839764,
      "endMs": 842358
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "[ Groans ] Find the bathroom all right?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 842467,
      "endMs": 845368
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "Uh... yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 845470,
      "endMs": 848303
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "Well, you've won this round, Simpson... but I'll grind you into the earth like a bug!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 854779,
      "endMs": 859807
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "[ Laughing ] Aah! Ohh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 859918,
      "endMs": 863684
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "Simpson, be a dear and rub my legs till the feeling comes back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 864456,
      "endMs": 867755
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "A bug, I tell you! A bug! [ Laughing ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 868927,
      "endMs": 873421
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "[ Groans, Laughs ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 873531,
      "endMs": 875431
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "[ Sighs ] I'm gonna resign.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 875533,
      "endMs": 877660
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "I don't know why they made me union president in the first place.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 877769,
      "endMs": 880897
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "Because they love you down at the plant.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 881005,
      "endMs": 883473
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "Yeah, you're right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 883575,
      "endMs": 885475
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "Guys are always patting my bald head for luck... pinchin' my belly to hear my girlish laugh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 885577,
      "endMs": 890943
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "Hmm. That doesn't sound like they like you at all.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 891049,
      "endMs": 893779
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "You're right. First thing tomorrow, I'm gonna punch Lenny in the back of the head.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 893885,
      "endMs": 898379
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "[ Slurps, Grunts ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 898490,
      "endMs": 900617
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "Batten down those cowlicks. Straighten that part.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 903661,
      "endMs": 906755
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "Uncross those eyes, mister.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 906865,
      "endMs": 908765
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "But I can't! Oh, sorry, Quigley.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 908867,
      "endMs": 911563
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "Come on, honey. Smile!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 911669,
      "endMs": 913796
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "I bet you've got a beautiful smile.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 913905,
      "endMs": 917363
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "Why don't you share it with the world?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 917475,
      "endMs": 920069
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "[ Gasps ] There is no God! -[Shutter Clicks] Fellow workers, I've been meeting with Mr. Burns day and night, and I've had enough.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 920178,
      "endMs": 928348
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "Strike! Strike! Strike! Strike!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 928453,
      "endMs": 930580
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "All in favor of a strike? Aye!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 930688,
      "endMs": 932679
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "All opposed? -[Man]Nay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 932791,
      "endMs": 935021
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "Who keeps saying that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 935126,
      "endMs": 937754
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "It was him. Let's get him, fellas.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 939197,
      "endMs": 942598
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "[ Angry Shouting ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 942700,
      "endMs": 944600
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "[ Chuckling ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 944702,
      "endMs": 947671
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "## [ Acoustic Guitar]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 950275,
      "endMs": 953403
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "## [ Folk Ballad ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 954979,
      "endMs": 959439
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "[ Angry Shouting ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 976467,
      "endMs": 978526
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "Ahh, this is the life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 978636,
      "endMs": 980934
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "Smithers, get me some strikebreakers, the kind they had in the '30s.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 981039,
      "endMs": 985100
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "We can't bust heads like we used to...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 985210,
      "endMs": 987872
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "but we have our ways. [ Murmuring Agreement ] One trick is to tell them stories that don't go anywhere... like the time I caught the ferry over to Shelbyville.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 987979,
      "endMs": 999054
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "I needed a new heel for my shoe... so I decided to go to Morganville... which is what they called Shelbyville in those days.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 999157,
      "endMs": 1009121
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "So I tied an onion to my belt... which was the style at the time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1009234,
      "endMs": 1013771
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "Now, to take the ferry cost a nickel.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1013872,
      "endMs": 1016500
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "And in those days, nickels had pictures of bumblebees on 'em.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1016608,
      "endMs": 1021409
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "\"Give me five bees for a quarter,\" you'd say.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1021512,
      "endMs": 1024845
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "Now, where were we? Oh, yeah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1024949,
      "endMs": 1026849
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "The important thing was that I had an onion on my belt... which was the style at the time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1026951,
      "endMs": 1033323
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "They didn't have white onions because of the war.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1033424,
      "endMs": 1036985
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "The only thing you could get was those big yellow ones.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1037095,
      "endMs": 1040360
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "[ Shouting ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1040465,
      "endMs": 1042296
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "Full power, Smithers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1042400,
      "endMs": 1044368
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "[ Yells, Whimpering ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1045670,
      "endMs": 1049436
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "## [ Folk Ballad Continues ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1051643,
      "endMs": 1053941
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "Now do \"Classical Gas.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1066391,
      "endMs": 1068416
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "Ooh, look at him strutting around Like he's cock of the walk.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1083241,
      "endMs": 1086210
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "Well, let me tell you, Homer Simpson is cock of nothing!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1086311,
      "endMs": 1089474
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "Hmm? Why, you and I can run this plant ourselves.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1089580,
      "endMs": 1093812
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "Crush! Kill! Destroy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1125483,
      "endMs": 1128884
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "Tonight on Smartline, the power plant strike-- argle-bargle or foofaraw?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1130154,
      "endMs": 1134857
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "With us tonight are plant owner C.M. Burns... union kingpin Homer Simpson... and talk show mainstay Dr. Joyce Brothers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1134959,
      "endMs": 1142396
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "I brought my own mike! Yes. Well.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1142500,
      "endMs": 1145025
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "Homer, organized labor has been called a lumbering dinosaur.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1145136,
      "endMs": 1149266
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "[ Screams ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1149374,
      "endMs": 1151137
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "My director is telling me not to talk to you anymore.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1151242,
      "endMs": 1153836
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "Whoo-hoo! - Mr. Burns, you mentioned you wanted an opening tirade.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1153945,
      "endMs": 1157813
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "Yes, thank you, Kent.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1157915,
      "endMs": 1159815
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "Fifteen minutes from now, I will wreak a terrible vengeance on this city!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1159917,
      "endMs": 1163876
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "No one will be spared! No one!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1163988,
      "endMs": 1167480
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "A chilling vision of things to come.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1167592,
      "endMs": 1169856
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "[ Dings ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1176467,
      "endMs": 1178059
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "Oh, for God's sake! [ Whimpers ] Good-bye, Springfield!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1194352,
      "endMs": 1200487
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "From hell's heart, I stab at thee!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1200591,
      "endMs": 1203651
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "[ Excited Shouting ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1212437,
      "endMs": 1215372
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "## [ Folk Ballad ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1224615,
      "endMs": 1226913
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "####[Continues]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1236627,
      "endMs": 1238925
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "Look at them all, through the darkness I'm bringing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1243267,
      "endMs": 1246065
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "They're not sad at all. They're actually singing!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1246170,
      "endMs": 1249071
    },
    {
      "index": 271,
      "text": "They sing without juicers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1250374,
      "endMs": 1252706
    },
    {
      "index": 272,
      "text": "They sing without blenders.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1252810,
      "endMs": 1255608
    },
    {
      "index": 273,
      "text": "They sing without flunjers, capdabblers and smendlers!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1255713,
      "endMs": 1260173
    },
    {
      "index": 274,
      "text": "Ooh! Tell Simpson I'm ready to deal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1260284,
      "endMs": 1263253
    },
    {
      "index": 275,
      "text": "All right, Homer, you can have the dental plan... on one condition-- you must resign as head of the union.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1263354,
      "endMs": 1271757
    },
    {
      "index": 276,
      "text": "Whoo-hoo! [ Whooping ] Smithers, I'm beginning to think that Homer Simpson... was not the brilliant tactician I thought he was.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1271863,
      "endMs": 1281262
    },
    {
      "index": 277,
      "text": "[ Whooping ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1281372,
      "endMs": 1286139
    },
    {
      "index": 278,
      "text": "We're going back to work! [ All Cheering ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1288913,
      "endMs": 1291711
    },
    {
      "index": 279,
      "text": "[ All ] Yea!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1301159,
      "endMs": 1303059
    },
    {
      "index": 280,
      "text": "Oh, honey, you can hardly see your new braces!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1305163,
      "endMs": 1308462
    },
    {
      "index": 281,
      "text": "And that's the tooth!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1308566,
      "endMs": 1310534
    },
    {
      "index": 282,
      "text": "Oops. I left the gas on.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1316507,
      "endMs": 1319135
    },
    {
      "index": 283,
      "text": "[Laughing Continues]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1327852,
      "endMs": 1330721
    },
    {
      "index": 284,
      "text": "[ People Chattering ] Shh! www.tvsubtitles.net",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1375833,
      "endMs": 2000
    }
  ]
}
